  "_pacing": "Tuned together at 150 runs; see balance-targets.md. waveClearGold puts income in the gap so the prep window has something to spend; midWaveBuildPercent takes it back if you react late. The pair lands 24.0% runs lost against a 27.3% baseline -- inside the 15-30% late target and within noise of before. prepTicks is a FEEL knob the sim cannot measure at any value: the policy spends down then calls the wave, so no timer ever binds. 300 (10s) is a placeholder to be tuned by playing. earlyCallGoldPerSecond stays 0 until prepTicks is tuned, or it is just free gold.",
